# Gigwork — Final Design 

- Original page layouts, Tailwind classes, page-specific styling, and inline JavaScript are retained as much as possible.
- Inline CSS has been moved to each page's `style.css`.
- Every page is available at `<page-folder>/index.html`.
- Start from the root `index.html` to browse the pages.
- Tailwind CSS and Google Fonts still load from their original external CDN links, so internet access is required for those resources.
- Links with clear destinations have been connected to local pages. Some links that refer to features not represented by a separate page remain placeholders.
